<title>USA: ConAgra Inc sells trucking units.</title>
<headline>ConAgra Inc sells trucking units.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConAgra Inc said Friday it sold its Monfort Transportation Co and Lynn Transportation Co trucking units to AmeriTruck Distribution Corp.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The sale of Greely, Colo.-based Monfort and Oskaloosa, Iowa-based Lynn is part of the food company's plan to divest non-core businesses, ConAgra said.</p>
<p>Shares of ConAgra were up 3/8 at 60-3/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
